{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-05_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-05",
  "title": "確認交戰視界",
  "storyCode": "14-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9a971f7c6bf69c38f86aee7f72ee6e7ecd2926ee27c78a716c1f53035f703a0f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "找到你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瘋子……你和他們說的一樣，是瘋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你確實很了解我。那麼，你一定知道落到我手裡的人都是什麼下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說吧，你們在卡茲戴爾附近還有什麼部署？這場過於簡單的戰鬥背後到底藏著什麼秘密？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算我懶得弄清楚特雷西斯扔下卡茲戴爾這事裡頭有什麼不可告人，但也別把我當白癡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也沒能擺脫我的巫術，你以為你還能撐多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "撐到你跪地求饒，把該交代的都交代出來為止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "傭兵啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你覺得自己總能活下來……每個人在死前都是這麼以為的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有人會是被死亡遺忘的寵兒，眾魂等著呢，你逃不掉，她也逃不掉……你們都是徒勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？我願意退場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽好了，薩卡茲，與軟弱告別吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "新的時代已經來了，那才是屬於我們的時代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕，那個“我們”之中，已經沒有我的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W！你剛剛——你的手……醫療幹員，這裡需要緊急處理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "媽的，這傢伙主動引爆了手榴彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泥沼終於消退，腐爛的氣味被強風吹散。可眼前的這片荒野，卻為何還是這麼昏暗？\n不安的感覺越來越強烈。\n那些薩卡茲戰士死前的表情，可稱得上是……虔誠。\n這樣的表情，怎麼會出現在他們那種人臉上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，聯繫上本艦了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小隊之間的通訊恢復了一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，與本艦的通訊至今還有干擾，可能是附近有正在蔓延的活性源石環境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，我們沒收到本艦遇襲的訊息，更何況，還有殿下本人和那位博士坐鎮呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這場仗，我們就快贏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "車在哪裡？我們馬上回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，我們還沒有接到下一步的行動指令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果貿然行動，有可能會打亂博士的規劃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等一下，W，有通訊——是Scout！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Scout說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔小隊成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巴別塔只是一個落腳點，和以往的任何一個都沒什麼區別，W一直是這麼以為的。\n也許，這裡能隨時提供乾淨的食物和水，這裡不會輕易拋棄已經失去行動力的傷患，這裡有幾個還算有趣的傢伙。\n但說到底，只要能歇腳，都一樣。\n和赫德雷與伊內絲一起行動之前，W已經不止一次失去過棲身之所。\n有時她回到營地，卻發現營地已經陷入一片火海，有時則是她親手點燃火苗。\n她習以為常，沒有薩卡茲真的以為自己能享受平靜與安寧，毀滅才是常態，動盪才帶來樂趣。\n可是，在看到倒塌的橫樑，看到走廊裡還未乾涸的血，看到吼叫著發出指令的醫生的時候——\n她發現，自己真切地感覺到了……崩塌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓讓，都讓開，這裡也有傷患！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快，把急救室全部空出來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別擋路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴別塔成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不知道，所有安保系統都失效了，凱爾希醫生正在——等等，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是你們做的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別他媽的說這種話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來她的血……也與我們並無不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "昏暗再度侵襲視野，詛咒總是難以消退。\n黑夜擁抱一切光芒，黑夜吞噬一切光芒，沒有人能逃得開黑夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戰鬥已經結束了，紛爭也已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽好了，薩卡茲，勝利者是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無角的刺客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一柄利刃洞穿了無角刺客的胸膛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W，巴別塔應該沒有向你發出任何指令，你為什麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要和我談我的違規問題？現在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯卡綸看著她。\nW與阿斯卡綸已經共事了不短的時間，但還是第一次看到她露出這樣的表情。這個冰做的刺客……竟然也會有如此哀傷的眼神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……阿斯卡綸，Scout說的都是真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不該在這個時候回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W，徹底掃蕩整艘船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅德島還沒有擺脫危險，凱爾希醫生有緊急情況要處理，現在只能靠我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我問你，特蕾西婭殿下在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我需要你首先前往動力層，那裡可能是他們最先潛入的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你他媽是聾了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們說她死了，我總要見一見……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽好了，薩卡茲雇傭兵W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你不想她的全部努力……都化為泡影，如果你不希望巴別塔就此崩塌，那就去幹你該幹的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈！你們這些廢物，你們全都是些廢物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真可笑，我居然會信任你們，我居然曾經相信你們可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我看到了。\n議長室裡，只有滿地鮮血，和雜亂的腳印。\n其餘的，什麼都沒有剩下。\n就如同什麼都沒有存在過。\n黑暗是這麼濃稠，黑暗總是這麼濃稠。\n特蕾西婭殿下死了。\n而且，我都沒能再見她一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下？您為什麼在這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這扇門還在這——什麼時候修好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，可露希爾還是有點用的嘛，總算幹了點事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老女人也是……您走了以後，羅德島還沒走到解散的地步，她盡力了，小兔子也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有我……我……想要再見您。來到倫蒂尼姆之後，我就一直想著什麼時候能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下，其實我一直挺搞不懂的，您到底為什麼一直……要讓自己這麼……這麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像我一直搞不懂，您為什麼，會對那扇壞掉的門那麼關心……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特蕾西婭，已經離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那現在站著的到底是誰……不，我一定是在做夢，殿下怎麼會對我說話。我是在自言自語嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可薩卡茲還有未竟的事業，我會將自己獻於這條道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了所有人，都可以安然入夢的那個將來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我理解不了，但我願意相信您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那您怎麼辦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭轉過身，推開了門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "門打開了。\n特蕾西婭邁開腳步，無數身影跟隨在她的身後。\n他們的聲音迴盪著，他們的聲音尖嘯著。\n“薩卡茲不會被拯救。”\n“無人能逃離苦難，因為我們曾經苦難。無人能擺脫憎恨，因為我們曾經憎恨。”\n“所有無意義的死亡，所有被浪費的希望……樂園何在？安寧何在？”\n特蕾西婭的腳步如此沉重，如此緩慢。\nW張了張嘴，她該說什麼呢？她又能說什麼呢？\n她終於意識到，剛才發生的並非對話，只是殿下留下的一些殘響。\n可她還是忍不住，向那個身影發問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下，如果您還活著，我該怎麼做才能拯救您？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "繼續向前走吧，你們會走到比我更遠的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼才算走得更遠……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我殺了你，就可以拯救你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有回答。\n特蕾西婭沒有回頭，那些身影也沒有回頭。\n哪怕他們的腳步是如此緩慢，他們的方向卻從未改變。\n特蕾西婭的身影漸行漸遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "壓抑已久的聲音終於喊出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去他媽的眾魂，去他媽的苦難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會為您重新找回平靜。不，也許殿下您從沒獲得真正的……可是——啊啊！管他的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把這些……結束吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殿下，我會把這些結束的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭的腳步是不是停下了一瞬呢，W不能確定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的身影漸漸朦朧，溶化，消失在了一片光芒之中。\n黑暗再次襲來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是，什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你聽到了，那位魔王留下的殘響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還活著——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喀利喀的身影不知何時出現在了W的身後，炸彈與落石依舊沒有在他身上留下痕跡。\n他走到W身邊，緩緩闔上了那扇門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位殿下已經遠去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我炸了你的老巢，你竟然還這麼心平氣和？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陳舊的遺跡，終歸塵土，何時損毀並無區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還真是豁達——有意思，我得承認我開始對你有點興趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是很厲害嗎？那之前一個個魔王就沒人想派你去幹點更有用的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我侍奉的殿下……奎薩圖什塔，超越歷史的雄主，在時間的長河中，他如同巨人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我追隨他征戰，我的兵刃供他驅使，這副身軀，也本該用於延續他的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，看來不管多麼瘋魔的傢伙，都有幾個忠心耿耿的擁護者啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "實驗失敗了，我未能延續自己的使命，只得將自己流放。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無用之人，只能收集那些英雄的殘片存放各處，憑弔過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我始終在等待……一個推開未來之門的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾經以為，那個人會是特蕾西婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "身形瘦削的人拾起地上破碎的祭壇殘片，將它碾為細碎的粉末。隨即，用沾滿了暗淡粉末的手指，沿著面頰深深抹下。\n就如同在臉上留下了一道淚痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "特蕾西婭殿下已經遠去，她最後的殘響由你拾起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魔王的舊部，年輕的薩卡茲。你出現在這裡，未必是巧合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯哼，我也這麼覺得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "摸到了赦罪師的老巢，怎麼也得留點東西才行啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "喀利喀低下頭，不知何時，數枚炸彈已經安置在他腳下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你為何……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不得不說，在我認識的老傢伙裡，你還算比較有趣的一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但作為和赦罪師有關的人，我還是得給你留點“禮物”才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀利喀",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "傭兵，你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去特雷西斯的墓碑上找吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
